            "x": 64,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⏱ Trigger test\n\nUpdated Application polls every minute; its first poll only records the applications that already exist. The provoke lane creates a prospect (a candidate always gets an application), waits 2 minutes (do not remove the Wait) and then updates the candidate's title. Greenhouse updates the application's updated_at when candidate data changes, which fires the trigger. Run this flow alone: other changes to applications at the same time would also fire it."
        }
